<title>USA: Metro Global names new president.</title>
<headline>Metro Global names new president.</headline>
<dateline>CRANSTON, R.I. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro Global Media Inc said Thursday that Daniel Geribo, a company director since October 1995, would become president, succeeding Kenneth Guarino, is leaving for personal reasons.  </p>
<p>Geribo has been president of Capital Video Corp, a private company owned by Guarino, since November 1994. He will retain that position, the company said.</p>
<p>Geribo said in a release that he will &quot;continue to follow the lead set by Mr. Guarino.&quot;</p>
</text>
